derivations.claim:
By [A1] and [F4], the induced covariant derivative obeys the tensor product rule, so differentiating $j_\xi^a=-T^{ab}\xi_b$ and using the given $
abla_aT^{ab}=0$ gives $
abla_a j_\xi^a=-(
abla_aT^{ab})\xi_b-T^{ab}
abla_a\xi_b=-T^{ab}
abla_a\xi_b$.

By [A1] and [F3], the induced tensor product rule and the supplied source equation give $
abla_a j_\xi^a=-(
abla_aT^{ab})\xi_b-T^{ab}
abla_a\xi_b=-f^b\xi_b-T^{ab}
abla_a\xi_b$.
